== VRChat community ==
The show also lives in VRChat, around a studio world and a group.

=== TVRS Studio ===
TVRS Studio is a VRChat world made for the show. Its listing on VRC List calls it the official world for the series and says monthly live events happen there.<ref name="vrclist">[https://vrclist.com/world/277354 "TVRS STUDIO VRChat World by PHIAbunny"] on ''VRC List''. Retrieved November 10, 2026.</ref>

The studio's opening shows up in the titles of PHIA's Patreon posts from 2022: "TVRS Main Lobby Preview" on August 1, "August Meetup and TVRS Studio Tour!" on August 18, and "TVRS Studio Launches this weekend!" on September 11.<ref name="patreon">[https://www.patreon.com/phia/sitemap "Sitemap"] on ''Patreon'' (PHIA). Lists post titles and dates only. Retrieved November 10, 2026.</ref>

=== Group ===
The show's group is called ''The Virtual Reality Show - PHIA Community'' and has the shortcode [https://vrc.group/TVRS.0429 TVRS.0429].<ref name="groupfair">See the 2025 tables on [[Community:Group Fair|Group Fair]], which list the group under this name and shortcode.</ref> In a March 25, 2024 Steam post, VRChat said the group holds monthly live events at TVRS Studio, with performances and a chance to find new communities and hang out with PHIA.<ref name="steam-2024">[https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/438100/view/4124807130953115141 "Join The Virtual Reality Show with VRChat Celebrity Interviews on March 29th!"] on ''Steam'' (VRChat announcement). Dated March 25, 2024. Retrieved November 10, 2026.</ref>

=== Events ===
[[File:TVRS_Celebrity_Interviews_Poster.webp|thumb|Poster for the March 29, 2024 ''Celebrity Interviews'' event at TVRS Studio. It lists the guests as Moon, Twice, WispyWoo and Zinpia.<ref name="steam-2024" />]]

The same Steam post advertised ''VRChat Celebrity Interviews'' for March 29, 2024. GreatMoonAroma, WispyWoo, Zinpia and TwiceVR were set to appear live in-world at 6:00 pm EST (3:00 pm PDT), with live VR musicians and an afterparty. Several official instances were open to join.<ref name="steam-2024" />

In October 2025 the group joined [[Community:Group Fair|Group Fair]] with two hangouts: ''TVRS Hangouts: Chill Night'' on October 24 (7:00 to 9:00 PM UTC) and ''TVRS Hangouts: World Hopping'' on October 25 (10:00 PM to 12:00 AM UTC).<ref name="groupfair" />

PHIA's Patreon page also announces regular meetups. The posts run from at least January 2021 to July 2026, and some titles say where they happen, like "April VRChat Meetup Date" (2025) and "Impromptu Patreon Meetup! (in Resonite)" (2024).<ref name="patreon" />

