== TVRS Wiki and the PHIA Phorce ==
The show has also inspired a fictional universe. The '''TVRS Wiki''' is a separate site with a science-fiction setting built around a group called the PHIA Phorce. It says it started as a fan wiki and is now its own production under different branding, with some staff in common with the official channel, and that PHIA has given permission to use the TVRS intellectual property. The site credits PHIA as the creator of the show, the lead of the "Bee-Sus" storyline, and the designer of a VRChat world for the setting's Bee-Sustainable Company, ''HIVE-7''.<ref name="tvrswiki">[https://tvrswiki.net/ph/TVRS:About "TVRS:About"] on ''TVRS Wiki''. Retrieved November 10, 2026.</ref>

